Content:
Shidaa lala
1 Oo, nyɛdaa Yehowa shi, ejaakɛ ehi;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
2Oo, nyɛdaa nyɔŋmɔi aNyɔŋmɔ lɛ shi;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
3Oo, nyɛdaa nuŋtsɔmɛi aNuŋtsɔ lɛ shi;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
4Mɔ koome ni efeɔ naakpɛɛnii wuji lɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
5Lɛ mɔ ni ekɛ nilee bɔ ŋwɛi amli ŋwɛii lɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
6Lɛ mɔ ni elɛɛ shikpɔŋ lɛ mli eha nui lɛ anɔ lɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
7 Lɛ mɔ ni ebɔ hulu kɛ nyɔɔŋtsere lɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
8Ebɔ hulu koni eye shwane nɔ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
9Ebɔ nyɔɔŋtsere kɛ ŋulamii koni amɛye nyɔɔŋ nɔ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
10 Lɛ mɔ ni etswia Ijipt kromɔbii lɛ nii lɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
11Lɛ ejie Israelbii lɛ kɛje Ijipt lɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
12Ekɛ nineshiwalɛ kɛ kpɔiaŋwalɛ tsu enɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
13Lɛ mɔ ni egba Ŋshɔ Tsuru lɛ mli lɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa;
14ni ekpala Israelbii kɛtsɔ̃ teŋ kɛho lɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
15Shi eplenee Farao kɛ eta lɛ yɛ Ŋshɔ Tsuru lɛŋ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
16Lɛ mɔ ni ekpala emaŋ lɛ kɛtsɔ̃ ŋa lɛ nɔ lɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
17Lɛ mɔ ni etswia maŋtsɛmɛi wuji nii lɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
18Ni egbegbee maŋtsɛmɛi ni yɔɔ gbɛi lɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
19Sihon, Amorbii amaŋtsɛ lɛ,
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
20Kɛ Og, Bashan maŋtsɛ lɛ, hu;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
21Ni eŋɔ amɛshikpɔŋ lɛ ehã ewebii akɛ gboshinii lɛ
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
22Eŋɔ ehã etsulɔ Israel akɛ gboshinii;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
23Lɛ ji mɔ ni ekai wɔ be ni wɔfee butuu lɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
24Lɛ ejie wɔ yɛ wɔhenyɛlɔi lɛ adɛŋ lɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
25 Lɛ elɛɔ heloo fɛɛ;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!
26Oo, nyɛdaa Ŋwɛi Nyɔŋmɔ lɛ shi;
ejaakɛ naanɔ esuɔmɔ ni tsakeee lɛ hiɔ shi kɛyaa!

Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ yɛ ebe
1Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ kɛ ebe ni ato ahã lɛ; ni sane fɛɛ sane
ni baa je nɛɛ mli yɛ ebe ni Nyɔŋmɔ eto.
2Fɔmɔ be yɛ, ni gbele be hu yɛ;
nidumɔ be yɛ, ni nikpamɔ be hu yɛ.
3Be yɛ ni agbeɔ, ni be yɛ hu ni atsaa;
be yɛ ni akumɔɔ nɔ ni ama, ni be yɛ hu ni
atswaa amaa shi.
4Yaafo be yɛ, ni ŋmɔlɔ be hu yɛ;
awerɛhoyeli be yɛ, ni be yɛ ni ajoɔ.
5Be yɛ ni akɔlɔɔ tɛi ashɛrɛɔ ashwieɔ, ni be yɛ hu
ni akɛbuaa tɛi anaa;
be yɛ ni aloɔ mɔ atuu, ni be yɛ hu ni alooo
mɔ atuu.
6Be yɛ ni ataoɔ nii, ni be yɛ hu ni aŋmɛɔ nii ahe;
be yɛ ni akɛ nii toɔ, ni be yɛ ni ashɛɔ nii afɔ̃ɔ.
7Be yɛ ni atserɛɔ nii amli, ni be hu yɛ ni akpɛɔ nii;
be yɛ ni afeɔ dioo, ni be hu yɛ ni awieɔ.
8Suɔmɔ be yɛ, ni nyɛɛ be hu yɛ;
ta be yɛ, ni toiŋjɔlɛ be hu yɛ.
9Mɛɛ sɛɛ gbɔmɔ naa yɛ deŋme ni egboɔ he? 10Mina nitsumɔ ni Nyɔŋmɔ kɛfɔ̃ adesai anɔ koni amɛgbo he deŋme lɛ. 11Ehãa nɔ fɛɛ nɔ feɔ akɔnɔ yɛ ebe mli, asaŋ ekɛ naanɔ he susumɔ ewo adesa mli, kɛ̃lɛ adesa nyɛŋ ena ele nɔ ni Nyɔŋmɔ etsu kɛjɛ jeŋ shishitoo kɛyaagbee naanɔ. 12No hewɔ lɛ, mina akɛ nɔ ko nɔ ko bɛ ni hi hã gbɔmɛi, beiaŋ ni amɛyɔɔ wala mli, fe akɛ amɛmii ashɛ amɛhe, ni amɛye jeŋ ŋɔɔmɔ lɛ eko, ni amɛshwɛ amɛyinɔ; 13asaŋ akɛ Nyɔŋmɔ dɛŋ jɔɔmɔ ji akɛ mɔ fɛɛ mɔ aye, ni enu, ni ena deŋme ni egboɔ lɛ he miishɛɛ. 14-15Miyoo akɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ ni Nyɔŋmɔ fee lɛ, ehiɔ shi kɛyaa naanɔ; anyɛŋ akɛ nɔ ko afata he lɛ, anyɛŋ ajie nɔ ko kɛje mli hu. Nyɔŋmɔ efee nɔ lɛ nakai, bɔ ni afee ni gbɔmɔ adesa ashe lɛ gbeyei. Nɔ ni yɔɔ amrɔ nɛɛ lɛ, ebaho etee dã, ni nɔ hu ni baaba lɛ eba dã. Nyɔŋmɔ tiuɔ nɔ ni eba ni ewo lɛ gbɛ kɛtee momo lɛ sɛɛ.
Toikɔdɔmɔ saneyeli
16Asaŋ mina akɛ je nɛɛ mli lɛ, afeɔ efɔŋ yɛ he ni akojoɔ yɛ tete, ni afeɔ yiwalɛ nii yɛ he ni esa akɛ ayeɔ jalɛ sane yɛ tete. 17Mikɛɛ mihe akɛ, “Nyɔŋmɔ baakojo jalɔ lɛ kɛ mɔ fɔŋ lɛ fɛɛ, ejaakɛ eto be ehã sane fɛɛ sane kɛ nitsumɔ fɛɛ nitsumɔ.” 18Mikɛɛ mihe akɛ, yɛ adesai agbɛfaŋ lɛ, Nyɔŋmɔ miika amɛ koni etsɔ̃ɔ amɛ akɛ amɛtamɔ kooloi nɔŋŋ. 19Ejaakɛ adesa naagbee kɛ kooloo hu naagbee lɛ fɛɛ ekome; bɔ ni mɔ nɛ gboɔ lɛ, nakai nɔŋŋ mɔ nɛ hu gboɔ. Amɛ fɛɛ lɛ mumɔ kome amɛyɔɔ, ni gbɔmɔ ehiii fe kooloo, ejaakɛ amɛ fɛɛ lɛ yakanii ji amɛ. 20Amɛ fɛɛ lɛ he koome lɛ nɔŋŋ amɛyaa; amɛ fɛɛ lɛ su mli amɛjɛ, ni amɛ fɛɛ amɛbaatsɔ̃ su ekoŋŋ. 21Namɔ aaanyɛ ekɛɛ akɛ adesa mumɔ lɛ eyaa ŋwɛi, ni kooloo mumɔ lɛ eyaa su mli? 22No hewɔ lɛ, miyoo akɛ nɔ ko ehiii fe enɛ akɛ gbɔmɔ aye enitsumɔ mli ŋɔɔmɔ lɛ eko, ejaakɛ no ji egbɛfaŋ nɔ. Namɔ baanyɛ ekɛ adesa aku sɛɛ kɛba jeŋ koni ebana nɔ ni yaa nɔ yɛ egbele sɛɛ?
